msgstr "Ladarba jinqara"

#: src/postulo_imap/sync.py:77
#, draft
msgid ""
"One folder, never the inbox. Make a rule on your mail server that files recruiter mail here; Postulo reads nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Folder wieħed, qatt l-inbox. Agħmel regola fuq is-server tal-posta tiegħek li tpoġġi l-posta tar-recruiters hawn; Postulo ma jaqra xejn iktar."

